	(text "MIXER: U3A sums (-1 x each wiper) back to the input polarity; 1k series out.\nOUT = WIPER1 + WIPER2 + WIPER3 + WIPER4, clipping near +/-10 V (TL072 on +/-11.6 V).\nU3B unused: grounded follower."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "40e591a3-53e2-52c4-a067-284e9e768417")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR IMIX - S3 schematic: 4-channel DC-coupled buffered mixer (CV or audio). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "544ab35e-a1db-54f4-b2b9-12b1a7b4d1ce")
	)
	(text "CHANNELS 1-4 (Bread Modular imix topology): jack tip -> 100k -> inverting buffer (100k || 20p, gain -1)\n-> 100R -> RV pin 3 (CW); pin 1 (CCW) = GND; wiper -> 100k -> SUM. Input impedance 100k at any knob\nposition; the buffer drives the pot from ~0 ohm. TN grounds an unpatched input. Full CW = unity gain."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9b218764-e2b3-56d4-af21-dd10c7804fa8")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01 marks the Eurorack GND; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the +12V/-12V rails,\nfed from the header only through D1/D2, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c6e7c78f-c309-5399-82fa-9aaea6c84bb3")
	)
	(text "POWER: Eurorack +12V / -12V -> B5819W per rail -> +12V / -12V (about +/-11.6 V). J10 +5V unused.\nC3..C8: 100n at every op-amp supply pin; C1/C2: 10u bulk."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f77e6354-a5ef-5eed-b569-46aef2bad5a3")
	)
